{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202020","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120202001:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 잘 지내셨죠? 아르사, 소렌도 다시 만나서 반가워.","source_cn":"阿尔萨，索恩，还有<style=stress><pla...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6D9FDAB2796E1779","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 잘 지내셨죠? 아르사, 소렌도 다시 만나서 반가워.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 잘 지내셨죠? 아르사, 소렌도 다시 만나서 반가워.","variant_male_record_index":"118224","variant_female_record_index":"118225","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120202002:1":{"text":"크루거, 여긴 어쩐 일이세요?","source_cn":"克鲁格，你怎么会来这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x610C6685EFD8EB14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120202003:2":{"text":"며칠 뒤에 있는 오우거의 장례식에 초대하려고 왔어.","source_cn":"我来是想要告诉各位，奥格的葬礼即将在近期举行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC361CC300282F96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120202004:1":{"text":"시간이 된다면 오우거의 장례식에서 마지막을 함께 배웅해 줬으면 해.","source_cn":"如果诸位有时间的话，我真诚地希望你们能来参加葬礼，送他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACF3704AC07BD297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1120202004":{"text":"시간이 된다면 오우거의 장례식에서 마지막을 함께 배웅해 줬으면 해.","source_cn":"如果诸位有时间的话，我真诚地希望你们能来参加葬礼，送他最后一程。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACF3704AC07BD297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120202005:1":{"text":"여러분과 블랙하울 부족의 관계도 있고, 게다가 오우거의 마지막을 지켜봤으니까요.","source_cn":"诸位见证了奥格的逝去，同时也与黑嚎氏族有千丝万缕的关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC983E937995AF27D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120202007:1":{"text":"강자에 대한 경의를 표하기 위해 블랙하울 부족의 풍습에 따라 아주 성대한 장례식을 치를 예정이거든요.","source_cn":"按照黑嚎氏族的风俗，我们会以最隆重的方式举办，以此表达...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76F4E05526BAF3B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120202008:1":{"text":"그 강자가 힘을 얻기 위해 악마에게 영혼을 팔았다고 해도?","source_cn":"即使这位“强者”为了获得力量，将自己出卖给了恶魔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x632C5D83B72F819C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120202009:1":{"text":"그건 오우거의 본의가 아닐 거다. 그리고… 오우거 또한 자신의 행동에 대한 충분한 대가를 치렀어.","source_cn":"我相信那并非奥格的本意。而且……他也已经为自己的所作所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x725D770BDF5E958D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120202010:1":{"text":"어찌 됐든 오우거는 우리 블랙하울의 영웅이야. 우리도 부족의 관례대로 그분을 추모할 생각이고.","source_cn":"无论如何，奥格都是我们黑嚎氏族的英雄。我们将以送别勇士...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x840E35FF8B3E0B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120202011:1":{"text":"…그게 우리랑 무슨 상관인데?","source_cn":"……但这和我们又有什么关系？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4029007E0510CC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120202012:1":{"text":"소렌, 아르사. 너희는 이번 군가 축제의 승리자야.","source_cn":"索恩，阿尔萨，你们是这次战歌节的胜者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9619A55457F8092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120202013:1":{"text":"블랙하울 입장에서 우리는 너희와 같은 강자와 좋은 관계는 물론, 친구가 될 수 있다면 더할 나위 없이 좋지.","source_cn":"于公而言，黑嚎希望能和像你们这样的强者维持好关系，若是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68C9016E744B8E0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120202014:1":{"text":"개인적으로는… 너희는 오우거의 마지막을 지켜보았고, 악마에게 고통받고 있는 그를 구원해 줬어.","source_cn":"于私而言……你们见证了奥格的终局。在他被恶魔操控而痛苦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33726DE76067D715","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120202015:1":{"text":"그걸 구원이라고 생각한 적 없어.","source_cn":"我不认为那叫拯救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AEFE08CA518C44D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120202016:1":{"text":"…적어도 너희는 내가 해내지 못한 일을 해냈어. 난 아무것도 못 하고 있었으니까.","source_cn":"……至少，你们做到了我没能做到的事情。那个时候，我帮不了他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0C04F20698F808A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120202017:1":{"text":"나와 오우거의 고마움을 표하기 위해 초대하는 거라고 생각하면 어떨까?","source_cn":"就当是我为了表达谢意才来邀请你们的如何？也为了帮奥格表...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EE42AA8931D6A5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120202018:1":{"text":"필요 없어.","source_cn":"我不需要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164341254976D635","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120202019:1":{"text":"그래, 괜찮아, 좀 더 생각해 보라고. 그리고 브루투스 님도 초대했어. 아마 그분도 오우거의 장례식장에서 너희와 다시 만나기를 바라고 있을 거야.","source_cn":"没关系，你还有时间考虑。不过，我们还邀请了布鲁特斯大人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BA141F0F6905EFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120202020:1":{"text":"난… 상관없는데... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각해?","source_cn":"这……我去不去都行啦，<style=stress><p...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3748DE5FC61EB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난… 상관없는데... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각해?","female":"난… 상관없는데... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각해?","variant_male_record_index":"118244","variant_female_record_index":"118245","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1120202020":{"text":"난… 상관없는데... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각해?","source_cn":"这……我去不去都行啦，<style=stress><player_name></style>大人觉得呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3748DE5FC61EB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난… 상관없는데... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각해?","female":"난… 상관없는데... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각해?","variant_male_record_index":"118244","variant_female_record_index":"118245","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120202021:2":{"text":"미안. 블랙하울과는 더 이상 엮이고 싶지 않아. 당신들을 믿기도 어렵고…","source_cn":"抱歉，我已经不想和黑嚎再有任何瓜葛了。更何况……我也信...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A233898D3C755A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120202022:1":{"text":"블랙하울 영지에서 겪었던 불미스러운 일에 대해서는 사과하지. 하지만 다 이유가 있었어. 다시는 그런 일이 없을 거라고 장담하고.","source_cn":"之前你在黑嚎营地确实经历了很多不愉快的事情，我对此深表...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3745B9DAC664CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120202023:1":{"text":"소렌, 난 너와 블랙하울… 그리고 오우거의 관계 때문에 널 장례식에 초대하려는 게 아니야.","source_cn":"索恩，我并不是因为你与黑嚎……与奥格的关系，才来邀请你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F31AB55A41A868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1120202024:1":{"text":"너의 혈통과 상관없이, 난 너의 강함을 존중할 뿐이야. 내 눈에 너는 우르 부족의 소렌이야.","source_cn":"我将你视作一位纯粹的强者，与你身体里所流淌的血液无关，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0C4385819D51A95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1120202025:1":{"text":"누누히 얘기했지만 블랙하울은 힘을 숭배해. 그리고 강자는 우리 블랙하울의 존중을 받아 마땅하지.","source_cn":"你知道的，黑嚎推崇力量。面对真正的强者，只会尊敬万分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE53A9DBA88A67D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1120202026:1":{"text":"진심이 느껴지는데… 소렌, 넌 어때?","source_cn":"他好像还挺真诚的……索恩，你觉得呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63689E5FA8426CA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1120202026":{"text":"진심이 느껴지는데… 소렌, 넌 어때?","source_cn":"他好像还挺真诚的……索恩，你觉得呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63689E5FA8426CA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1120202027:2":{"text":"…좋아. 장례식에는 가도록 하지. 하지만 딱 거기까지야.","source_cn":"……好。我会参加葬礼。但是，也就仅此而已了。","status":"matched"